flowchart TD
    A[GET /api/recommendations] --> B[Display AI Suggestions to Tester]

    B --> C{Tester Decision}

    C -- Reject --> D[Mark Suggestion as Rejected]
    D --> E[Store Review Status]
    E --> F[Return Rejected Result]

    C -- Approve --> G[Mark Suggestion as Approved]
    G --> H{Attack Execution Allowed?}

    H -- No --> I[Return Execution Blocked]
    H -- Yes --> J[Execute Approved Test Safely]

    J --> K[Capture Evidence]
    K --> L[Store Logs and Screenshots]
    L --> M[Return Attack Execution Result]